{
  "description": "A settings.json as v1.0.0 wrote it, with only the keys that existed then. Its values load unchanged; every key added later (the critical level, alert points and per-row alerts, row visibility, the providers' AutoRenewSession and CreditsFullAmount) takes its default.",
